+ *	Whether the rule just filled in at idx puts the same frames on the wire
+ *	as one before it.
+ *
+ * The ports of a tag_8021q DSA bridge all resolve to the conduit with the
+ * VID the tagger gives the bridge, and the switch delivers that one frame
+ * to every port of the group itself. A rule per port would have the
+ * firmware send one copy per port, and the switch deliver each of them to
